# Build outputs.
/target
/isodir
/build
*.iso
*.o
*.bin

# grub/ holds the prebuilt boot stub, not build products, so it stays tracked
# despite the *.o / *.bin rules above.
!grub/**

# 7d3f9a2c/ is a reference checkout of another OS used as a gap-analysis
# baseline (see DONTTOUCH.md). It is not Samsara source, nothing in the build
# reads it, and it carries its own .git -- so it is deliberately untracked
# rather than vendored, and its name is deliberately opaque so the tree does
# not advertise where the reference came from. Re-create it with:
#
#   git clone <upstream> 7d3f9a2c
#
# DONTTOUCH.md is untracked for the same reason: it is a working note about
# that checkout, not documentation of this system.
/7d3f9a2c
/DONTTOUCH.md
